    "title": "60-Year-Old Passenger Dies After Mustang, Jeep Collide in Hempstead - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Holden Draper ,\n10 hours ago Long Beach Rd. & Windsor Pkwy. — Reported Intersection of Fatal Collision. A 60-year-old man riding in a Ford Mustang was killed after the car collided with a Jeep Wrangler at the intersection of Long Beach Road and Windsor Parkway in Hempstead. The passenger, who has not been publicly identified, was pronounced dead at a hospital, while both drivers survived with only minor injuries. Read full article\n2",
